                                        ;      |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  +----- left
                                        ;      |  |  |  |  |  |  |  +-------- right
                                        ;      |  |  |  |  |  |  +----------- up
                                        ;      |  |  |  |  |  +-------------- down
                                        ;      |  |  |  |  +----------------- short fire
                                        ;      |  |  |  +-------------------- up left
